<title>JAPAN: Moody's rates NSW Treasury Corp's dual samurai Aa2.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates NSW Treasury Corp's dual samurai Aa2.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service Inc said on Thursday it had assigned its Aa2 rating to New South Wales Treasury Corp's yen/Australian dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due in October 1999.</p>
<p>The rating agency did not elaborate.</p>
</text>
